From: Kleis Auke Wolthuizen <github@kleisauke.nl>
Date: Tue, 25 Oct 2022 11:07:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Remove background thread in `vips_sink_screen`

This thread is only used when the `notify_fn` callback is passed to
`vips_sink_screen`, which does not happen internally in libvips.

